  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 52 + 36 ÷ 9 × 3 − 1 = 210.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) − and +\n\nGiven: 52 + 36 ÷ 9 × 3 − 1 = 210\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 52 - __**36 ÷ 9**__ × 3 + 1 = 210\n\n⇒ 52 - __4____** × 3**__ + 1 = 210\n\n⇒ __**52**__ - 12 __**+ 1**__ = 210\n\n⇒ __**53 - 12**__ = 210\n\n⇒ 41 ≠ 210\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) × and +**\n\nGiven: 52 + 36 ÷ 9 × 3 − 1 = 210\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 52 × __**36 ÷ 9**__ + 3 − 1 = 210\n\n⇒ __**52 × 4**__ + 3 − 1 = 210\n\n⇒ __**208**____** + 3**__ − 1 = 210\n\n⇒ __**211 − 1**__ = 210\n\n⇒ **210 = 210**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 52 + 36 ÷ 9 × 3 − 1 = 210\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 52 + 36 × __**9 ÷ 3**__ − 1 = 210\n\n⇒ 52 + __**36 × 3**__ − 1 = 210\n\n⇒ __**52 + 108**__ − 1 = 210\n\n⇒ __**160 − 1**__ = 210\n\n⇒ 159 ≠ 210\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 52 + 36 ÷ 9 × 3 − 1 = 210\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 52 + 36 - 9 × __**3 ÷ 1**__ = 210\n\n⇒ 52 + 36 - __**9 × 3**__ = 210\n\n⇒ __**52 + 36**__ - 27 = 210\n\n⇒ __**88 - 27**__ = 210\n\n⇒ 61 ≠ 210\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
